      "caption_for": "fig_0058"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0307",
      "reading_order": 375,
      "section": "3.8.2 Wiring of Parallel UPS System",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.384,
        "t": 355.2576629101563,
        "r": 241.54568,
        "b": 345.786101363195
      },
      "content": "Connection of parallel power cable"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0308",
      "reading_order": 376,
      "section": "3.8.2 Wiring of Parallel UPS System",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 339.6576629101563,
        "r": 541.56592,
        "b": 298.98610136319496
      },
      "content": "If  there  is  only  one  circuit  with  power  supply,  first  connect  each  UPS  into  the  \"public  input connection\",  and  connect  the  input  terminals  of  each  UPS  together,  so  do  output.  Schematic diagram of wiring is as shown in Figure 3-28."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0309",
      "reading_order": 377,
      "section": "3.8.2 Wiring of Parallel UPS System",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 292.85766291015625,
        "r": 541.61376,
        "b": 252.1861013631949
      },
      "content": "If  separated  bypass  connection  is  used,  it  is  necessary  to  remove  the  copper  bars  with  short connected the internal main input and bypass input, and then connect the rectifier input terminals of each UPS together, so do bypass input; the connection of phase sequence should be correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0059",
      "reading_order": 378,
      "section": "3.8.2 Wiring of Parallel UPS System",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.64686077858376,
        "t": 244.8455040022784,
        "r": 94.17752374834107,
        "b": 226.71264485153426
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0059.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0309",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0310",
      "width": 19,
      "height": 18,
      "decorative": true,
      "image_hash": "458a9eb65568229634cda6b210e8e06b0c29bb2d67702a90d46a8a25eec8e17c"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0310",
      "reading_order": 379,
      "section": "3.8.2 Wiring of Parallel UPS System",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 74.064,
        "t": 233.45766291015627,
        "r": 541.5859200000002,
        "b": 205.35610136319497
      },
      "content": "Battery cable is connected in the same way as stand-alone UPS and the battery pack of UPS can't be shared."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0060",
      "reading_order": 380,
      "section": "3.8.2 Wiring of Parallel UPS System",
      "bbox": {
